OL,3,ADaniel Thomas admits boat criminal
OL,4,Adamage in channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FActivist Daniel Thomas, also known as
OL,7,FDanny Tommo, has admitted criminal
OL,8,Fdamage after slashing a migrant dinghy
OL,9,Fwith a knife in the English Channel.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old changed his plea to the
OL,12,Fsingle charge when he appeared via
OL,13,Fvideo link from prison at Portsmouth
OL,14,FCrown Court on Thursday.
OL,16,FA court previously heard that he had
OL,17,Ftaken a boat into the English Channel
OL,18,Fand observed the migrant occupants of a
OL,19,Fdinghy being assisted by the RNLI
OL,20,Flifeboat charity, Border Force and the
OL,21,FFrench Coastguard.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
